
# ⚡ PulseAnalytics — Team Analytics Dashboard

A modern, responsive team analytics dashboard designed to help organizations monitor employee performance, manage goals and KPIs, track attendance, analyze departmental productivity, and generate business reports from a centralized interface.

🌐 **Live Demo:** https://analyticsdashb.netlify.app/

