The dashboard uses a modern administrative interface with clear navigation and reusable visual components.

### Sidebar Navigation
The sidebar provides access to the seven main modules.

### Header
The top header includes:

- Current page title.
- Breadcrumb navigation.
- Global search.
- Role selector.
- Theme toggle.
- Notifications dropdown.

### KPI Cards
Summary cards highlight important workforce indicators.

### Interactive Charts
Charts provide visual representations of trends and distributions.

### Data Tables
Structured tables display employees, goals, attendance records, and report definitions.

### Modal Dialogs
Modal forms support actions such as adding employees, creating goals, managing reports, and exporting data.

### Notifications
The notification dropdown provides a central interface for reviewing notifications and marking them as read.

### Light and Dark Themes
Users can switch the display theme through the header control or settings page.

### Responsive Design
The HTML includes mobile navigation controls and a mobile overlay to support a smaller-screen layout.

Responsive behavior depends on the accompanying CSS implementation.

